  "correct_answer": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Volume of the parallelopiped&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>v</mi></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>v</mi></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>|</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>"
